{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this cozy single player game, you explore wondrous landscapes to find a legendary lost treasure. In your search for clues, you travel from island to island and set up camp with your crew of adventurers. They task you with finding different places in the surrounding landscape. Explore the island, find the locations you are looking for and pinpoint them on your map. Complete quests for your companions and follow the trace of the hidden treasure.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/d94b6e9d4f047c44e39b7bab8dba063b.avif?t=1772791050\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/5ca84fbe808af317ffa579abacb7ca4d.poster.avif?t=1772791050\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/5ca84fbe808af317ffa579abacb7ca4d.webm?t=1772791050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/5ca84fbe808af317ffa579abacb7ca4d.mp4?t=1772791050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use real cartography logic to mark landmarks, ruins, and secrets as accurately as possible onto your map. You choose how to approach each challenge, using observation and creativity to find your own solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/1c93cecfd02323cef6d9466857b6ecf2.avif?t=1772791050\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/9c92ff5c4aad7904bda6bff603b0b422.poster.avif?t=1772791050\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/9c92ff5c4aad7904bda6bff603b0b422.webm?t=1772791050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/9c92ff5c4aad7904bda6bff603b0b422.mp4?t=1772791050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use and unlock proper navigation tools to measure your steps, navigate by compass, and scan the horizon with telescopes and sextants to triangulate your way across each island.\u00a0Each new tool you discover opens up many new ways to map each island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/fc3110393e3ed25b00e3d256d8013959.avif?t=1772791050\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/d815f92ec88c13d59786c994141a19dd.poster.avif?t=1772791050\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/d815f92ec88c13d59786c994141a19dd.webm?t=1772791050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/d815f92ec88c13d59786c994141a19dd.mp4?t=1772791050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each island is filled with ancient ruins, wildlife, hidden paths, and cozy little details that reward curiosity and careful observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/69186236af2bbf42cd4047ff34f395f4.avif?t=1772791050\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/5cbd95a5af663b09d75605b892a69ea7.poster.avif?t=1772791050\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/5cbd95a5af663b09d75605b892a69ea7.webm?t=1772791050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/extras/5cbd95a5af663b09d75605b892a69ea7.mp4?t=1772791050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Orient yourself naturally by reading the landscape and enjoying the gentle thrill of understanding a place on your own.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2702260?t=1772791050","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2702260?t=1772791050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/9c647f68cdaf96d8c84d835c6313732615108b5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772791050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702260/9c647f68cdaf96d8c84d835c6313732615108b5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772791050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descript